Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 23:25:52 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 07736/11362] [outer-loop] ARC live-search-on-scored-env
 characterization (REQ-ARC-WMTE-5840)

Tests the true live-search engine (StepwiseExplorer via CarnotAgentPolicy searching
the ONE env run_game gives it, no separate arcade) + perception verifier. tu93 at
budget 2000 (is the non-idempotent-reset block fundamental or budget?) + g50t (the one
idempotent-reset game with a derived nav pair). Characterizes the honest boundary of
live search on the scored env.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JntPrUGLNesPcJH1pyfFYw
